{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/448668-how-can-gentry-without-realm-titles-turn-people-into-changelings","id":448668,"title":"How can Gentry without Realm Titles turn people into changelings?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-18T19:47:42-07:00","id":448668,"title":"How can Gentry without Realm Titles turn people into changelings?","content":"In page 79 of Autumn Nightmares, there is a Gentry called Nergal who has no Realm, but can turn people into changelings nonetheless.<br /> <br /> So, how else can the Gentry turn humans into changelings? Do they have to be inside the Hedge? Can prolonged/dramatic exposure to Props, Wisps and Actors also result in a new changeling?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T20:01:03-07:00","id":448696,"title":"","content":"Owing fealty to or partaking of the hospitality of one of the Others and having exposure to Arcadia are pretty much the only requirements for starting the transition. The bond of implicit or explicit promise is the defining aspect; your being metaphysically Theirs is what matters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T20:28:15-07:00","id":448747,"title":"","content":"Also worth remember is that every Stranger has a Domain, irregardless of having a Realm or not.<br /> <br /> But predominantly, it's because to play ball in those Domains, a stranger in these lands must bargain with the Strangers before food will fill, water will quench, and fire will warm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T12:56:28-07:00","id":451955,"title":"","content":"Also, there's no such thing as a Realm Title. Any Title can be spun into any form: Actor, Realm, Prop or Wisp(s). And as ArcaneArts says, you don't need to make a deal with the Gentry to become a changeling; that's a consequence of spending time in Arcadia. Arcadia wants to be experienced, so generally speaking, a Domain, even unclaimed, will permit a visitor to breathe its air, drink its water, eat and derive nourishment from its food, etc. That's its service to the visitor. In return,the visitor gives permission for the Domain to alter him. None of this occurs on the level of conscious thought, for Domains do not think. It's just how Arcadia works. Though spectacularly improbable, it's entirely possible for a human to enter a domain, spend time there, become a changeling, leave, get back to Earth, and never encounter a Gentry or even a hobgoblin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}